    "title": "Where to watch The Masters today. See channels, coverage times",
    "text": "Updated April 9, 2026, 9:22 a.m. ETThe 2026 Masters is here.The best golfers in the world will compete in the season's first major championship starting on Thursday, April 9.Defending champion Rory McIlroy has returned and is hoping to be the first golfer to win back-to-back jackets since Tiger Woods in the early 2000s. So, how can you watch today? Here's what to know:What channel is The Masters on?Prime Video will cover The Masters from 1-3 p.m. ET. ESPN will cover The Masters from 3-7:30 p.m. ET. All main feed coverage for all four days can also be found on Masters.com and the Masters App.Where can I watch The Masters live?The Masters livestream is available for free on CBSSports.com and the CBS Sports app.How to watch The Masters full schedule for ThursdayThe following schedule is from Masters.com.Honorary Starters CeremonyMasters.com/Masters App: Approx. 7:30 a.m.On The RangeMasters.com/Masters App: 8:30 a.m.-10:30 a.m.CBS Sports Digital, CBS Sports Network, Paramount+: 8:30 a.m.-10:30 a.m.First Round BroadcastMasters.com/Masters App: 1 p.m.-7:30 p.m.ESPN, ESPN App, ESPN Deportes: 3 p.m.-7:30 p.m.Prime Video: 1 p.m.-3 p.m.Holes 4, 5 & 6Masters.com/Masters App: 8:45 a.m.-3:30 p.m.ESPN App: 8:45 a.m.-3:30 p.m.Featured GroupsMasters.com/Masters App, CBS Sports Digital, DirecTV, ESPN App, Paramount+, Prime Video: 9:15 a.m.-7:30 p.m.Amen CornerMasters.com/Masters App, CBS Sports Digital, DirecTV, ESPN App, Paramount+, Prime Video: 10:45 a.m.-6 p.m.Inside Amen CornerMasters.com/Masters App, Prime Video: 10:45 a.m.-6 p.m.Holes 15 & 16Masters.com/Masters App, CBS Sports Digital, DirecTV, ESPN App, Paramount+, Prime Video: 11:45 a.m.-7 p.m.Live From The MastersGolf Channel: 8 a.m.-3 p.m.Golf Channel: 7:30-9:30 p.m.Welcome to the MastersESPN: 10 a.m.-12 p.m.Radio CoverageSiriusXM: 2-8 p.m.What time does The Masters start today?Round 1 of the Masters starts at 7:40 a.m. on Thursday, April 9. See a full list of tee times here.2026 Masters leader boardGet the latest leaderboard updates here.",
